<title>UK: Nordbanken sets $125 mln perpetual frn.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken sets $125 mln perpetual frn.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	SPREAD   **70 BP     MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    27.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.875    FULL FEES   0.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    99.875</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL FROM 27.SEP.01</p>
<p>	     **UNTIL YEAR FIVE, THEREAFTER 223 B.P. IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10 (REG)  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
